      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know if it matters, but should the order be Ike then Network? We might also want to look into the code that can how hold WiFi alive while disconnect procedures are done. It was added for IWLAN, and it would be swanky if VCN and VPN could use that hook as well. (if nothing else, it can ensure we get an optimistic DELETE sent before the network goes away?)",
